{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_04E760","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Alan Turing博士也被称为计算机科学之父。可以说，AI的基础理论就是由他奠定的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":106,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"二战期间，他在GC&CS工作。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":35,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"政府密码学校……负责破解Enigma吗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"没错。没有他，也许就无法破解德军的Enigma密码。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"……可后来，他却被逮捕了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"为什么？他不是终结大战的功臣吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"当时在英国，同性恋是犯罪。他是同性恋。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"我很能理解他的遗憾。我有义务连他的份一起，把AI研究继续发展下去……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":101,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"虽说喜欢的是不同性别的人，是吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"没错。知道吗？Turing Test的灵感，其实来自一个很普通的派对游戏。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":89,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"隔着屏风和对方笔谈，然后猜对方的性别。是女人，还是装成女人的男人……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"这其实出奇地难分辨。男人还是女人，机器还是人类……这些差别到底意味着什么。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"他一直思考着男女之间的差异。也许正是这让他产生了Turing Test的构想。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":95,"review_flag":""}]}